*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff]]''': Upgrades attack power by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 175 NP)

===Ultra Talents===
*'''[[Behemoth Slayer]]''': 5% chance to Dodge Behemoth enemies' attacks for 30f <sup>1s</sup> (Cost: 150 NP)
*'''[[Slow]]''': Adds a 100% chance to slow enemies for 24f <sup>0.8s</sup>, improves by ~3.6f per level up to 60f <sup>2s</sup> (Total Cost: 285 NP)
*'''[[Shortened Cooldown]]''':  On every other deployment, this unit starts with 5% of its cooldown already completed, improves by 5% per level up to 50% (Total Cost: 285 NP)
*[[Immune to Explosions|'''Immune to Explosion''']]: (Cost: 150 NP)
*'''[[Zombie Killer]]''': (Cost: 150 NP)

