==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]], his English description erroneously described his Resistance as "Strong vs.".
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], The Majestic Zeus was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Advent of the Almighty (Removed Combo)|Advent of the Almighty]].
*Prior to [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]], Almighty Zeus was one of the few [[:Category:Cats with Ultra Talents|Cats with Ultra Talents]] to lack a second [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] slot.
*In [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Almighty Zeus' Slow Ultra Talent was buffed from 1 second max duration to 2 seconds.
*[[wikipedia:Zeus|Zeus]] is the god of the sky and ruler of all gods in Greek mythology.
*The [[Mystery Mask]] bears a slight resemblance to the golden face above Thunder God Zeus.
*Along with [[Hare of Inaba (Uber Rare Cat)|Hare of Inaba]], they are the very first units with Shortened Cooldown ability.
**In Almighty Zeus' case, he gain Shortened Cooldown ability through Ultra Talents.

